{
  "name": "Pioneer DDJ-FLX4",
  "about": "The DDJ-FLX4, from Mixxx's DDJ-FLX4 mapping (not checked on the hardware). Laid out as the DDJ-400, but: BEAT FX CH1 / CH2 on 94 10 / 95 11, with ON on 94 47 or 95 47; no headphone level message; the sampler's slots 1-4 and 9-12 on deck 1's pads, 5-8 and 13-16 on deck 2's. Its start message (Mixxx's, from Wireshark) asks where its controls are and has to be sent every 200 ms, or the unit stops talking. Mixxx lights the pad mode buttons itself; earshot doesn't yet.",
